From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cofre <cofre@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Let Cofre own Air launch and game exit

Reason: Cofre owns launch completion, first-frame handoff, launch failures and crash screens.
Restore Forge/NeoForge LWJGL module visibility now that Air strips split packages.
Keep Forge installs writing mappings and libraries under the libraries folder.
Drop when: Air exposes equivalent supported launch, launch-failure and game-exit callbacks,
stops excluding its LWJGL jar from BootstrapLauncher module discovery, and fixes those installer paths.
---
